CHAPTER.VERS:
Hear this word that Yahweh has spoken against you

          {+}
        , O sons of Israel, against the whole family which I brought up out of the land of Egypt, saying,

You

          {+}
         only I have known of all the families of the earth: therefore I will visit all your

          {+}
         iniquities on you

          {+}
        .

Publish

          {+}
         in the palaces at Ashdod, and in the palaces in the land of Egypt, and say, Assemble yourselves on the mountains of Samaria, and look at what great tumults are in it, and what oppressions are in the midst of it.

Hear

          {+}
        , and testify against the house of Jacob, says the Sovereign Yahweh, the God of hosts.
